<content><![CDATA[<media-image source="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/haxtheweb/art/main/presentation-materials/episode-xxvi/episode-xxvi-crawl.jpg" alt="A starfield with gold text tilted back into space: Episode XXVI, Return of the Open Web, the opening of a crawl about HAX in 2026."></media-image>
<p>A space-opera opening crawl that catches people up on HAX: where it came from, the web standards it stands on, and where it is in 2026. It ends on a Join the Rebellion card. Viewers with reduced motion get a static, readable version.</p>
<p><em>A parody of the classic sci-fi film opening crawl. The text and the synthesized fanfare are original, and no footage, logo or score is used.</em></p>
